'''Arbër Gashi''' (born 28 December 1994) is a Swedish politician of the [[Swedish Social Democratic Party]] who has served as a member of the [[Riksdag]] for [[Halland County (Riksdag constituency)|Halland County]] since July 2024.<ref name="riksdag">{{cite web |title=Arber Gashi (S) |url=https://www.riksdagen.se/en/members-and-parties/member/arber-gashi_c643fdd9-746d-40da-9ee9-8aa25123e221/ |publisher=Riksdag |access-date=15 April 2026}}</ref>

==Political career==
Before entering national politics, Gashi was active in local government in [[Halmstad Municipality]], where he served as chairman of the committee for children and youth.<ref>{{cite news |title=Arber Gashi (S) på väg till riksdagen |url=https://www.hallandsposten.se/nyheter/halmstad/arber-gashi-s-pa-vag-till-riksdagen |work=Hallandsposten |date=26 November 2023 |access-date=15 April 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |title=Skolpolitikern i Halmstad: ”Inte nödvändigtvis ett stort problem” |url=https://www.svt.se/nyheter/lokalt/halland/namndsordforande-vi-har-behoriga-larare-i-halmstad--6luq3t |work=SVT Nyheter |date=26 October 2023 |access-date=13 May 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |title=Lärare tvingas vikariera för varandra för att spara pengar |url=https://www.vilarare.se/nyheter/nedskarningar/larare-tvingas-vikariera-for-varandra-for-att-spara-pengar/ |work=Vi Lärare |date=25 September 2023 |access-date=13 May 2026}}</ref>

He became a member of the Riksdag on 16 July 2024 during the 2022–2026 parliamentary term, succeeding [[Adnan Dibrani]].<ref name="riksdag" /><ref>{{cite press release |title=Två nya ordförande utsedda |url=https://www.mynewsdesk.com/se/halmstadskommun/pressreleases/tvaa-nya-ordfoerande-utsedda-3330676 |publisher=Halmstads kommun |date=18 June 2024 |access-date=13 May 2026}}</ref>

==Parliamentary work==
In the Riksdag, Gashi serves as a member of parliament and as a deputy member of the Committee on Social Insurance.<ref name="riksdag" />

In 2025, he raised concerns regarding working conditions in the recycling sector following media reports and submitted a formal question to the Swedish government.<ref>{{cite news |title=Efter Stenaavslöjandet – riksdagsledamot kräver svar av minister |url=https://www.sverigesradio.se/artikel/efter-stenaavslojandet-riksdagsledamot-kraver-svar-av-minister |work=Sveriges Radio |date=23 October 2025 |access-date=15 April 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Trygg arbetsmiljö i återvinningsbranschen (Interpellationsdebatt 5 december 2025) |url=https://www.riksdagen.se/sv/webb-tv/video/interpellationsdebatt/trygg-arbetsmiljo-i-atervinningsbranschen_hd10146/ |publisher=Sveriges Riksdag |date=5 December 2025 |access-date=13 May 2026}}</ref>

